Thread Persistence Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant ThreadStore
    participant Database

    Agent->>ThreadStore: upsert(thread)
    ThreadStore->>Database: SELECT thread BY id

    alt Thread not found
        ThreadStore->>Database: INSERT thread (version=1)
    else Thread exists
        ThreadStore->>ThreadStore: Check version
        alt Version mismatch
            ThreadStore-->>Agent: Err(VersionConflict)
        else Version matches
            ThreadStore->>ThreadStore: Increment version
            ThreadStore->>Database: UPDATE thread
            ThreadStore->>Database: UPDATE git_commits
            ThreadStore->>Database: UPDATE threads_fts
        end
    end

    ThreadStore-->>Agent: Ok(thread)